SUMMARY:[BCI & Neurotechnology][EEG/MEG & Neural Signals] BCI Winter 2027 -
  Paper submission deadline (cutoff time unannounced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Winter Conference on Brain-Comp
 uter Interface\nWebsite: https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/\nSource URL: 
 https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/importantdate.php\nLocation: Jeongseon\
 , South Korea\nTopics: BCI & Neurotechnology\, EEG/MEG & Neural Signals\,
  Signal Processing\, Machine Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-ba
 sed\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Officia
 l 2027 site and CFP confirm February 22-24\, 2027 at High1 Resort\, Jeong
 seon\, with papers due November 15\, 2026 (up to 6 pages\, double-blind\,
  IEEE Xplore subject to quality review). No cutoff hour or zone is stated
 \; T23:59 AoE is provisional. The 2026 deadline moved from October to Dec
 ember\, so check for extensions. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: B
 rain-computer interfaces\, neural signal decoding\, multimodal brain meas
 urements\, neurofeedback and adaptive interfaces. Machine learning is cen
 tral to biosignal classification and decoding\; neurorehabilitation and i
 nteraction with real or virtual environments are characteristic applicati
 ons. IEEE-style reviewed research papers are the established publication 
 route.\nAdditional topics: Healthcare & Clinical AI\, Neuroimaging & Brai
 n Mapping\nScope sources (2027): https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/callfo
 rpaper.php\, https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2026/assets/CFP_BCI2026.pdf\nSc
 ope last checked: 2026-10-08\nOfficial deadline day\; exact cutoff hour/t
 imezone is unannounced. Verify the organizer's submission portal.
URL:https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/importantdate.php
END:VEVENT
